    3. Refresh tools/VERIFICATION.txt with the new release tag.
    4. Drop the new release notes into <releaseNotes/> (or keep the pointer).
    5. Run `choco pack` from this directory and `choco push` to chocolatey.org.

  Schema reference: https://docs.chocolatey.org/en-us/create/create-packages
-->
